{"id":"a462c08746e2f9f0","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ktrivial-ideal.md","title":"K 平凡 Turing 度形成理想","display":"thm-ktrivial-ideal — K 平凡 Turing 度形成理想","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ktrivial-ideal","aliases":["43-thm-ktrivial-ideal"],"display":"thm-ktrivial-ideal — K 平凡 Turing 度形成理想","depends_on":["[[43-thm-kt-ce-cover]]","[[43-df-ktrivial]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Cor.15.1.31; Thm.15.1.47; Thm.15.1.27, printed pp.424–425,432 / PDF pp.444–445,452","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ktrivial-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ktrivial-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ktrivial-ideal — K 平凡 Turing 度形成理想"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"31ff1a30de04cdd5\" href=\"?note=31ff1a30de04cdd5\" title=\"43-thm-kt-ce-cover\">43-thm-kt-ce-cover</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Cor.15.1.31; Thm.15.1.47; Thm.15.1.27, printed pp.424–425,432 / PDF pp.444–445,452"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；K 平凡性、Turing 归约与 join 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land B\\le_T A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivial}(B).\n\\qquad(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land\\mathrm{KTrivial}(B))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A\\oplus B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land B\\le_T A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivial}(B).\n\\qquad(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land\\mathrm{KTrivial}(B))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A\\oplus B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>向下闭合由 Cor.15.1.31 给出。join 闭合先由 Thm.15.1.27 取 c.e. K 平凡覆盖 C,D 使 A≤tt C、B≤tt D；Thm.15.1.47 给 c.e. K 平凡度的理想性，故 C⊕D 为 K 平凡；A⊕B≤T C⊕D，再向下闭合。不可将独立 LowForK(A)、LowForK(B) 直接当作互相相对化低性，也不可把两个 K(n) 界相加。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-thm-kt-ce-cover","status":"resolved","id":"31ff1a30de04cdd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-kt-ce-cover]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；K 平凡性、Turing 归约与 join 见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；K 平凡性、Turing 归约与 join 见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；K 平凡性、Turing 归约与 join 见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land B\\le_T A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivial}(B).\n\\qquad(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land\\mathrm{KTrivial}(B))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A\\oplus B).","display":true}],"bytes":1490,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-372","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ktrivial-ideal]] — K 平凡 Turing 度形成理想"}],"outgoing":["31ff1a30de04cdd5","ccd45302acc926e6","0784d1de3a88cd94","be1278f108eb178d"]}